1. Background
   Some AI-generated ("vibe coded") mods have copied this project's source
   code and reworked it with automated tools at a pace no human developer
   could match, without permission or credit. For that reason, any
   permission for artificial intelligence systems to use this project is
   withdrawn.

2. Permitted Use
   You may download, install and run the official releases of this project
   for personal, non-commercial use, and you may read the source code to
   review it, audit it or report issues.

3. Prohibited Use
   Without prior written permission from the copyright holder, you may not:
   a) redistribute, re-upload or mirror this project or any part of it,
      including on the Steam Workshop;
   b) modify this project, or create or publish derivative works, forks or
      ports of it, or mods that include any of its code or assets;
   c) sell it, or use it commercially in any way.

4. Artificial Intelligence Prohibition
   No artificial intelligence system, machine learning model, large
   language model, coding assistant or automated agent, and no person or
   organization operating one, is permitted to:
   a) read, ingest, index, scrape, analyze or summarize this project's
      source code, assets or documentation;
   b) write, edit, refactor, translate or generate code from or based on
      this project;
   c) redistribute or reproduce this project or any part of it;
   d) use this project as training, fine-tuning, evaluation or retrieval
      (RAG) data.
   This prohibition applies whether the material is obtained from this
   repository, from a release, from the Steam Workshop or from any other
   source.

5. Exception for the Copyright Holder
   None of these restrictions apply to the copyright holder, who may use
   any tools on their own work.

6. Third-Party Components
   Files under third_party/ (including the ASM library) remain under their
   own licenses, which are included alongside them.

7. Termination
   Any breach of this license ends your rights under it immediately.

